# Weakness Map

## Valid sub-axes (exact keys used in DB and BKT)

```
vocabulary.work | vocabulary.family | vocabulary.travel | vocabulary.academic | vocabulary.daily
grammar.deHet | grammar.separableVerbs | grammar.v2WordOrder | grammar.subordinateClauses | grammar.verbConjugation | grammar.tenseUsage
pronunciation.gSchSounds | pronunciation.uiIjDiphthongs | pronunciation.longVowels | pronunciation.wordStress
listening
writing.formalRegister | writing.informalRegister | writing.emailStructure
register.formalU | register.informalJij | register.idioms
```

## BKT update (always use this, never raw scores)

```ts
import { updateSubAxis } from '@/lib/bkt'

// After a user answer:
await updateSubAxis(userId, 'grammar.separableVerbs', {
  correct: boolean,
  responseTimeMs: number,         // used for careless detection
  confidenceLevel: 'sure' | 'unsure' | 'guessing',  // optional
})
```

## Snapshot — save history after every session

```ts
import { saveWeaknessSnapshot } from '@/lib/weakness-map'
await saveWeaknessSnapshot(userId, sessionId)   // called at session end
```

## Mistake root causes (tag every mistake)

`INTERFERENCE` | `UNKNOWN` | `CONFUSION` | `CARELESS`

```ts
import { recordMistake } from '@/lib/mistakes'
await recordMistake({ userId, sessionId, subAxis, rootCause, responseTimeMs })
```

